<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back further 1.4 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back further 1.4 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand bought back a further 1.4 million shares on Friday between NZ$6.49 and $6.50, the New Zealand Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Telecom, which is continuing a NZ$1 billion buyback programe, closed four cents higher at $6.49 on heavy volume of 6.36 million shares. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
